     "body": "<p>Due to being unable to get a runnable fedora6 at present from HEAD, I will focus on building the tooling and initial profiling development on fedora5. </p>",
     "created": "18/Sep/19 11:32 AM",
     "id": "20751",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12948/comment/20751",
