      "accountId": "6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Dan Field",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8",
      "timeZone": "Europe/London"
     },
     "body": "<p>I am defining my initial dataset, taken from the NLW collections as everything ingested in Feb 2018. This equates to:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>5348 datastreams totalling `170MB` on disk</li>\n\t<li>5369 objects totalling `4.3GB` on disk</li>\n\t<li>data is stored in legacy FS format, not Akubra</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Although small, this will only form the initial test dataset. Other larger datasets will follow and will comprise a different ratio of datastreams to objects as well. </p>\n\n<p>I will initially run all tests from local solid state disk, performance stats below:</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>$ sudo hdparm -I /dev/sda\r\n/dev/sda:\r\n\r\nATA device, with non-removable media\r\n\tModel Number:       SanDisk SD8SBAT-256G-1006               \r\n\tSerial Number:      164547401752        \r\n\tFirmware Revision:  Z2311006\r\n\tTransport:          Serial, ATA8-AST, SATA 1.0a, SATA II Extensions, SATA Rev 2.5, SATA Rev 2.6, SATA Rev 3.0\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>$ sudo hdparm -Tt /dev/sda\r\n\r\n/dev/sda:\r\n Timing cached reads:   33416 MB in  1.99 seconds = 16816.65 MB/sec\r\n Timing buffered disk reads: 1530 MB in  3.00 seconds = 509.58 MB/sec\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>",
     "created": "19/Sep/19 5:10 AM",
     "id": "20757",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12948/comment/20757",
     "updateAuthor": {
