     "body": "<p>I've spent some time getting familiar with the config and process but I can not get the code to run past the following issue at present:</p>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>INFO 17:21:20.282 (InternalIDResolver) No index directory specified.  Creating temporary index at \"/tmp/tempfile1356584637906048365basedir/index\".\r\nINFO 17:21:20.355 (InternalIDResolver) Builidng an index of all the datastreams in \"/home/dof/fedora38_data_export/datastreams\"...\r\nINFO 17:21:20.803 (OCFLFedora4Client) to-be-implemented: OCFLFedora4Client: TODO what goes here,TODO what goes here\r\nWARN 17:21:20.804 (OpaqueIDMapper) Index exists at \"legacyFS-native-id-index\" and will be used.  To clear index, simply delete this directory and re-run the application.\r\nINFO 17:21:20.827 (Migrator) Processing \"llgc-id:4779390\"...\r\nDEBUG 17:21:20.924 (BasicObjectVersionHandler) Considering object llgc-id:4779390 version at 2018-02-01T14:57:37.313Z.\r\nINFO 17:21:20.924 (OCFLFedora4Client) to-be-implemented: createPlaceholder: null\r\nINFO 17:21:20.924 (OCFLFedora4Client) to-be-implemented: getRepositoryUrl\r\nException in thread \"main\" java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: value cannot be null\r\n\tat org.apache.lucene.document.Field.&lt;init&gt;(Field.java:240)\r\n\tat org.apache.lucene.document.StringField.&lt;init&gt;(StringField.java:60)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.migration.idmappers.OpaqueIDMapper.cacheObjectPath(OpaqueIDMapper.java:184)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.migration.idmappers.OpaqueIDMapper.mapObjectPath(OpaqueIDMapper.java:135)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.migration.handlers.BasicObjectVersionHandler.processObjectVersions(BasicObjectVersionHandler.java:185)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.migration.handlers.VersionAbstractionFedoraObjectHandler.processObject(VersionAbstractionFedoraObjectHandler.java:110)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.migration.handlers.ObjectAbstractionStreamingFedoraObjectHandler.completeObject(ObjectAbstractionStreamingFedoraObjectHandler.java:89)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.migration.foxml.FoxmlInputStreamFedoraObjectProcessor.processObject(FoxmlInputStreamFedoraObjectProcessor.java:150)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.migration.Migrator.run(Migrator.java:126)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.migration.Migrator.main(Migrator.java:61)\r\nINFO 17:21:20.925 (InternalIDResolver) Deleting index directory at \"/tmp/tempfile1356584637906048365basedir/index\"...\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>Working back through the stacktrace doesn't really help me identify the source of the problem</p>",
